                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">In later armies, a Senior Officer or Standard Bearer may ride in a chariot bought at extra cost from this list. Senior Officers have hand weapon, light armour, javelins and shield. Stubborn. Senior Officers may have bow (+4 points) if chariot mounted.</characteristic>
