              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Chariots Driver armed with hand weapon and shield, and one crewman armed with hand weapon, bow, javelins, light armour and shield. Crewman may have thrusting spear (+6 points). Light Chariots. Expert Horseman. Chariot Runners have Hand weapon, javelins and shield. Light Infantry; Chariot Runners. May not be more units of chariot runners than there are of chariots. Cavalry Hand weapon, thrusting spear and shield. Light Cavalry. Chariot Runners. May not be taken if infantry Chariot Runners are used.</characteristic>
