              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Gadites have hand weapon, javelins and shield. Warband (rule 2 does not apply). Light Infantry. Zubulanites two thirds hand weapon, thrusting spear and shield. One third has bow (-1 point). Light Infantry. Combined Formation. Benjaminites have hand weapon and bow. Different weapons may be mixed in the same unit. Benjaminites: may exchange bow for sling (-1 point) and may have buckler (+1 point). May only use sling in skirmish formation. Light Infantry. Issachar have hand weapon and javelins. Issachar: may exchange javelins for bow (+1 point). Skirmishers.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
