              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Benjaminites have hand weapon and bow. Different weapons may be mixed in the same unit. Benjaminites: may exchange bow for sling (-1 point) and may have buckler (+1 point). May only use sling in skirmish formation. Light Infantry.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
