              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Philistines Hand weapon, javelins, light armour and shield. Stubborn and hostile/indifferent to other cultures. Phoenicians have Hand weapon, javelins and bow. Option: May have light armour (+2 points). Edomites Hand weapon and javelins. Skirmishers.</characteristic>
